msgid "Byte transport, TCP, TLS and MQTT"
msgstr "字节传输、TCP、TLS 与 MQTT"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:12
msgid ""
"The selected byte transport and protocol profile have explicit owners and "
"storage. Ordinary consumers use opaque Nexus faces; exact supplier-backed "
"storage headers belong only to the static composition translation unit."
msgstr "选定的字节传输和协议配置具有显式所有者及存储。普通消费者使用不透明 Nexus 接口；具有厂商精确布局的存储头文件仅用于静态装配编译单元。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:16
msgid ""
"`byte_stream.h` defines immediate partial reads and copied writes with "
"finite absolute deadlines. SUCCESS reports local byte acceptance, not peer "
"delivery; BUSY with zero bytes requires explicit owner progress. No caller "
"buffer remains borrowed after a stream operation returns. The optional "
"`Nexus::LwIPTCP` client implements this face over the pinned NO_SYS IPv4 "
"stack. Products still own the executor, peer selection, trusted time, "
"entropy and shutdown/reconnect policy."
msgstr ""
"`byte_stream.h` 定义了带有限绝对截止时间的即时部分读取和复制写入。SUCCESS 表示本地字节准入，不表示已交付对端；BUSY "
"且字节数为零时，需要所有者显式推进。字节流操作返回后，不再借用调用者的缓冲区。可选的 `Nexus::LwIPTCP` 客户端在锁定的 NO_SYS "
"IPv4 协议栈之上实现此接口。执行器、对端选择、可信时间、熵源以及停机和重连策略仍由产品负责。"

