#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:100
msgid ""
"Select one singleton NO_SYS stack profile per image. The default "
"`Nexus::LwIP` and `Nexus::LwIPTCP` profiles retain copied RX and their "
"existing storage layouts. The explicit targets below select RX payload "
"loans; CMake rejects an image combining copied and loaned profiles, "
"including a copied TCP target combined with loaned adapter storage. These "
"targets create no second stack, netif, executor, worker or allocator."
msgstr ""
"每个镜像选择一个单例 NO_SYS 协议栈配置。默认 `Nexus::LwIP` 和 `Nexus::LwIPTCP` 配置保留复制式 RX "
"及其既有存储布局。下列显式目标选择 RX 负载借用；CMake 拒绝在同一镜像中组合复制式与借用式配置，也拒绝将复制式 TCP 目标与借用式 "
"adapter 存储组合。这些目标不创建第二个协议栈、netif、执行器、worker 或分配器。"

