#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:114
msgid ""
"The owner initializes lwIP once and attaches with "
"`nx_lwip_loaned_adapter_start`. Supply zero-initialized, disjoint adapter, "
"TX, fragment-view, frame-slot and custom-pbuf-piece storage. Select a "
"nonzero `slot_count` and at least `slot_count * base.rx_capacity` pieces, "
"with fragment capacity sized for the actual provider geometry. MAC payload "
"spans must also be disjoint from adapter, TX/view and slot/piece storage. "
"Invalid acquired spans are released without delivery. All raw APIs, "
"reference operations, callbacks, service and stop share the same serialized,"
" nonreentrant task owner. Live or reentrant attachment cannot erase retained"
" references or tokens."
msgstr ""
"owner 只初始化 lwIP 一次，并通过 `nx_lwip_loaned_adapter_start` 挂接。须提供零初始化且互不重叠的 "
"adapter、TX、片段视图、帧槽和 custom-pbuf 片段存储。选择非零 `slot_count`，并提供至少 `slot_count * "
"base.rx_capacity` 个片段；片段容量须按实际 provider 的描述符布局确定。MAC 负载区间也必须与 "
"adapter、TX／视图及槽／片段存储互不重叠。获取到的无效区间会被释放，不会交付。所有 raw API、引用操作、回调、service 和 stop"
" 共用同一个串行、不可重入的任务 owner。对仍存活实例的再次挂接或重入挂接不会清除保留中的引用或令牌。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:130
msgid ""
"Each frame slot copies at most 136 B into its own writable `PBUF_REF` "
"prefix. That prefix covers the 14 B Ethernet header, maximum 60 B IPv4 "
"header and maximum 60 B TCP header, including the fields that official TCP "
"input updates in place. The prefix can include payload; a frame of at most "
"136 B is copied entirely. Only bytes beyond the prefix reference the "
"original immutable MAC fragments through `PBUF_ROM` tails. Raw consumers "
"must treat those tails as read-only and clone before writing. This is RX "
"payload-tail zero-copy; whole-frame and TX zero-copy are not provided. ICMP "
"echo uses the official copy-for-reply path. VLAN delivery, IPv6, DHCP, DNS "
"and IP reassembly remain unselected."
msgstr ""
"每个帧槽最多将 136 B 复制到自身可写的 `PBUF_REF` 前缀。该前缀覆盖 14 B Ethernet 头、最大 60 B IPv4 头和最大"
" 60 B TCP 头，包括官方 TCP 输入路径会原地更新的字段。前缀可能包含负载；不超过 136 B 的帧会被完整复制。只有前缀之后的字节通过 "
"`PBUF_ROM` 尾部引用原始、不可变的 MAC 片段。raw 消费方必须将这些尾部视为只读，并在写入前克隆。这是 RX "
"负载尾部零复制；不提供整帧或 TX 零复制。ICMP echo 使用官方的复制后回复路径。VLAN 交付、IPv6、DHCP、DNS 和 IP "
"重组仍未选用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:141
msgid ""
"A retained head or tail pbuf reference keeps its frame slot and exact MAC "
"loan live. The final custom-pbuf free only marks pieces returned; it never "
"calls the provider or rearms DMA. Subsequent owner service or stop releases "
"the exact loan after every piece's final reference is gone. A failed release"
" retains the token and storage and closes further adapter admission. "
"Products first close PCBs and join raw users, callbacks, queues and "
"observers. Stop returns BUSY while any pbuf reference remains and detaches "
"only after exact RX release and the existing MAC/TX withdrawal obligations. "
"Failed drain never revokes a loan."
msgstr ""
"保留的头部或尾部 pbuf 引用会使其帧槽及精确 MAC 借用持续存活。custom-pbuf 的最终释放只标记片段已归还；它从不调用 "
"provider，也不重新武装 DMA。在每个片段的最后一个引用都结束后，后续 owner service 或 stop "
"才释放精确借用。释放失败会保留令牌与存储，并关闭后续 adapter 接纳。产品须先关闭 PCB，并等待 raw "
"用户、回调、队列和观察者退出。只要仍有任何 pbuf 引用，stop 就返回 BUSY；只有精确 RX 释放及既有 MAC／TX "
"撤离义务均已完成后才解除挂接。排空失败绝不撤销借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:150
msgid ""
"Slot count is metadata capacity, not a provider capability or an ACK-"
"progress promise. Concurrent acquisition also requires independent provider "
"loans and enough descriptors for the actual frames. The maintained enhanced "
"F407 MAC engine supports independent held RX heads and reverse-order release"
" in software models; this fact does not establish universal capacity, "
"lossless operation or progress under arbitrary retained traffic. Products "
"budget and release loans for their selected frame geometry and workload."
msgstr ""
"槽位数是元数据容量，不是 provider 能力，也不承诺 ACK 推进。并发取得还要求独立的 provider "
"借用，以及足以容纳真实帧的描述符。受维护的增强型 F407 MAC 引擎在软件模型中支持独立持有 RX "
"头和逆序释放；这不证明通用容量、无损运行或任意保留流量下的推进。产品根据所选帧几何与负载制定预算并释放借用。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:158
msgid ""
"The selected loaned profile keeps two spare 512 B `PBUF_POOL` payload "
"blocks; the copied profile keeps its existing 24 blocks. The 16 KiB arena "
"and other fixed protocol pools remain unchanged. RX custom-pbuf metadata, "
"136 B prefixes, MAC buffers and the copied TX buffer are additional caller-"
"supplied storage. TX and ICMP reply fallback may use the existing bounded "
"RAM allocator. These counts require the curated organization fork's narrow "
"exemption of the explicit custom-RX/custom-pbuf profile from the stock "
"`PBUF_POOL`/`TCP_WND` sizing heuristic. Every other stack sanity check "
"remains active. This exemption does not establish stock-upstream admission "
"or complete SRAM fit. Nominal pool counts are not a complete SRAM "
"measurement."
msgstr ""
"选定的借用式配置保留两个备用的 512 B `PBUF_POOL` 载荷块；复制式配置仍使用既有的 24 块。16 KiB arena "
"和其他固定协议池保持不变。RX custom-pbuf 元数据、136 B 前缀、MAC 缓冲区和复制式 TX 缓冲区仍需调用方另行提供存储。TX 和 "
"ICMP 回复回退可使用既有的有界 RAM 分配器。该池容量需要维护的组织 fork，仅让显式 custom-RX／custom-pbuf 配置豁免原版"
" `PBUF_POOL`／`TCP_WND` 容量启发式检查。其他协议栈 sanity 检查全部保留。此豁免不能证明原版上游也准入该配置，或证明完整 "
"SRAM 可容纳。标称池计数不是完整 SRAM 测量。"

