#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:175
msgid ""
"FIG-32 is a reference host-test data flow, not a product architecture or MCU"
" network qualification. Solid bidirectional edges carry the same ciphertext "
"over two independent TCP connections: software Ethernet frames between the "
"Nexus client and a test-only lwIP peer, then a host socket between the "
"transparent relay and local Mosquitto. The dashed edge identifies the one "
"TLS session, which terminates at the Nexus TLS client and Mosquitto; the "
"relay does not decrypt or terminate TLS. Each lwIP process owns its own "
"serialized stack and clock. {download}`Editable DOT "
"<../../../../assets/diagrams/lwip-tcp-tls-mqtt-host.dot>` and the [network "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/protocols/network/README.md) and [maintained relay "
"fixture](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/lwip_mqtt_interop/README.md) define this figure's "
"source and lifetime boundaries."
msgstr ""
"FIG-32 描述主机测试的数据流参考，不是产品架构或 MCU 网络资格。双向实线在两条独立 TCP 连接上传送同一密文：Nexus "
"客户端与仅用于测试的 lwIP 对端之间使用软件以太网帧，透明中继与本地 Mosquitto 之间使用主机 socket。虚线标出唯一的 TLS "
"会话，其端点是 Nexus TLS 客户端和 Mosquitto；中继不解密或终止 TLS。每个 lwIP "
"进程拥有各自的串行协议栈和时钟。{download}`可编辑 DOT <../../../../assets/diagrams/lwip-tcp-"
"tls-mqtt-host.dot>`、[网络合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/protocols/network/README.md) "
"以及[维护的中继工装](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tests/contracts/lwip_mqtt_interop/README.md) 给出图的源码及生命周期边界。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:187
msgid ""
"The host fixtures exercise actual pinned stack and protocol implementations "
"with software frame ports and controlled services. Direct POSIX TLS/MQTT "
"fixtures and the full lwIP/TCP relay fixture retain their own execution "
"evidence. Neither model Ethernet nor a real host broker proves Board wiring,"
" physical PHY/DMA, MCU entropy quality, measured resource peaks, installed "
"SDK acceptance or HIL."
msgstr ""
"主机工装使用软件帧接口和受控服务，执行实际锁定的协议栈与协议实现。直接 POSIX TLS／MQTT 工装和完整 lwIP／TCP "
"中继工装各自保留执行证据。模型以太网或真实主机 broker 都不证明 板卡接线、物理 PHY／DMA、MCU 熵质量、实测资源峰值、安装版 SDK "
"验收或 HIL。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/api/components/protocols/network.md:193
